Reproduced offline (bug hunt 2026-09-26).

1) lib/Langertha/Engine/Ollama.pm:115-119 new_openai(tools => \@mcp_tools) passes tools to OllamaOpenAI->new, which has no tools attribute (no StrictConstructor), so the list is discarded; the POD promises it is passed on. Fix: drop the parameter and its POD, or map it to what it was meant to be (mcp_servers?).

2) lib/Langertha/Role/Models.pm:70 clear_models_cache clears only _models_cache; the lazy_build models attribute keeps its first value, so $e->models after clear_models_cache is stale although the POD says the next access re-fetches. Repro: subclass with a counting list_models -> models returns m1 before and after clear. Fix: also call $self->clear_models (lazy_build provides the clearer).

3) lib/Langertha/Engine/Gemini.pm:593 chat_response maps modelVersion but not responseId, so Response.id is undef on Gemini while every other engine sets it. Fix: $data->{responseId} ? (id => ...) : (), and the same on the final stream chunk if Stream::Chunk carries an id.
